## C# Operators
### Arithmetic operators
```
(+) addition
(-) subtraction
(*) Multiplication
(/) Division
(%) Mod
(++) Increment
(--) Decrement
```

### Assignment operators
```C#
=
+=
-=
*=
/=
%=
&=
|=
^=
>>=
<<=
```

### Comparsion operators
```
==
!=
>
<
>=
<=
```

### Logical operators
```
&&&
||
!
```
